---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Heritage &amp; Budaya - Desa Umbu Pabal" activePage="heritage">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover" 
        alt="Ancient Banyan Tree or Historical gathering in Indonesian village" 
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBjNze4nuQaRSXSXjx-N68dN27yiiEjw7IJkNL1Lil1C4N-apcwJi1axAaiwwdZbhL903Dr5gU9o5XW_oMPUGcO5MiuzA8ZPpfvcVbJehj4aWcJW02i8b07CP4-wJ0U3H43N4WwBzqrjPAcZqowvF8XZ_ZSlrj1gBILJUlzQhZEezhWl6pLgeL6ez_utYvcPz_tmROJnOL0VjrlQHkdOctt-yI-3_LhRIP_-xYLGGHVYETvT0sH-PU-UUAsKnm86Qq7iWAXVxBDlxU"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/75 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 text-center text-white px-gutter max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-label-md font-label-md mb-4 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">Warisan Budaya</span>
      <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl mb-4 font-bold text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">Menjaga Tradisi, Merangkul Masa Depan</h1>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg opacity-90">Sejarah panjang gotong royong dan kearifan lokal yang membentuk pondasi pelestarian alam di Desa Umbu Pabal.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- History Timeline Section -->
  <section class="py-section-padding-desktop bg-surface-bright">
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary text-3xl font-bold">Garis Waktu Sejarah Desa</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto">Perjalanan hampir dua abad dari pemukiman agraris kecil hingga menjadi desa digital percontohan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative border-l border-outline-variant max-w-3xl mx-auto pl-8 space-y-12">
        <!-- 1824 -->
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1.5 bg-primary text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-white shadow"></div>
          <span class="text-secondary font-headline-md text-xl font-bold block">1824</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary mt-1">Awal Pemukiman Agraris</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 font-body-md">Didirikan oleh sekelompok pelopor petani padi yang menjunjung tinggi semangat gotong royong dan keselarasan dengan hutan tropis di sekitar lembah.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- 1945 -->
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1.5 bg-primary text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-white shadow"></div>
          <span class="text-secondary font-headline-md text-xl font-bold block">1945</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary mt-1">Integrasi Administratif</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 font-body-md">Menyusul kemerdekaan Indonesia, desa secara resmi diakui dalam tata kelola pemerintahan kabupaten dengan nama resmi Desa Umbu Pabal (Desa Lestari).</p>
        </div>
        <!-- 2004 -->
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1.5 bg-primary text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-white shadow"></div>
          <span class="text-secondary font-headline-md text-xl font-bold block">2004</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary mt-1">Deklarasi Cagar Alam &amp; Konservasi</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 font-body-md">Masyarakat berkomitmen menjaga 85% wilayah sebagai hutan lindung dan menerapkan batasan ketat pembangunan demi kelestarian mata air alami.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- 2024 -->
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1.5 bg-primary text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-white shadow"></div>
          <span class="text-secondary font-headline-md text-xl font-bold block">2024</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary mt-1">Era Digital Stewardship</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 font-body-md">Menerapkan teknologi digital, sensor IoT pertanian, dan layanan mandiri online demi efisiensi tanpa mengorbankan nilai sosial dan budaya adat.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Traditional Arts & Crafts Section -->
  <section class="py-section-padding-desktop bg-surface-container-low">
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-label-md font-label-md text-xs font-bold">KERAJINAN TANGAN</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary text-3xl font-bold mt-4 mb-6">Tenun Ikat Tradisional</h2>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Kain tenun kami dikerjakan secara manual oleh Koperasi Wanita desa menggunakan benang katun pilihan dan pewarna alami yang diekstrak dari tumbuh-tumbuhan lokal. Motif geometris yang khas menceritakan hubungan spiritual masyarakat dengan hutan dan air.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-outline-variant">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary bg-secondary-container/30 p-3 rounded-full">workspace_premium</span>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">Produk Cagar Budaya</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Warisan turun-temurun bersertifikasi keaslian nasional.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img 
            alt="Artisan weaving textile" 
            class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full aspect-video object-cover" 
            src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDnLSoXYxYyU0Fqw9gmAJaPP9ANoWN-myxiTMlnhpzcQimC97D17uFP0kPFZzA612TxZ42X-N3zIrKl0p4hc8kL5yyOsRrTixPweA-e35NJSs74_2cNtjEpS1QPj_JCMqw7OZE9j0rPYkrXmqLQotAJiw_xyf44dte6flkMPmqcApprZDC8ykj-ShdVeiA_-0wDHuISsLjMdzmsXiCVekr0xBdhgDP7ER77un-NxG1QU89BR_MXpuCYvf9FjHLim4TaDjv5NdQ1kUY"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-section-padding-desktop bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container">
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter text-center">
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Jelajahi Kampung Budaya Kami</h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto opacity-90">Kunjungi langsung pusat kebudayaan untuk melihat pengrajin menenun secara langsung dan mencicipi hidangan kuliner tradisional.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/galeri" class="bg-[#D4AF37] text-[#191c1d] px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-label-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all text-center font-bold">
          Lihat Galeri Budaya
        </a>
        <a href="/event" class="border border-on-primary-container px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-label-md hover:bg-on-primary-container hover:text-primary-container transition-all text-center">
          Jadwal Agenda Festival
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
